Description: Run agentdfir to produce a sealed, tamper-evident .adfir evidence package for AI-agent artifacts
Category: AIAgents
Author: AgentDFIR Project
Version: 0.1
Id: 8b2e5d1a-7c3f-4a9b-8d6e-agentdfir002
BinaryUrl: https://github.com/efij/AgentDFIR/releases
ExportFormat: adfir
Processors:
    -
        Executable: agentdfir.exe
        CommandLine: collect --product claude --out %destinationDirectory%\claude.adfir --operator KAPE
        ExportFormat: adfir
        ExportFile: claude.adfir

# The resulting package is verifiable independently:
#   agentdfir verify claude.adfir
